sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Analyst
  participant UI as Browser UI (remediation.js)
  participant API as FastAPI /api/sim
  participant SVC as sim_service
  participant ENG as engines (analysis, whatif, remediation)
  participant SIM as Environment (in memory)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>UI: Open finding, "Preview and remediate"
  UI->>API: POST /remediation/preview {kind, id}
  API->>SVC: preview_remediation()
  SVC->>DB: load active environment + history
  DB-->>SVC: rows
  SVC->>ENG: analysis.analyze(env)
  ENG-->>SVC: fresh findings + plan (operations, plan_hash)
  SVC->>ENG: whatif.simulate(env, operations)
  ENG->>SIM: env.copy() and apply operations on the copy
  ENG-->>SVC: comparison (cost, score, downtime, diff), baseline_unchanged = true
  SVC->>DB: store what-if run + audit REMEDIATION_PREVIEWED
  SVC-->>UI: PROPOSED plan + preview
  U->>UI: Tick confirmation, "Apply"
  UI->>API: POST /remediation/apply {plan_hash, confirm=true}
  API->>SVC: apply_remediation()
  SVC->>ENG: re-analyse and compare plan_hash (409 if changed)
  SVC->>ENG: run_operations(env, operations) all-or-nothing
  ENG->>SIM: lifecycle.execute for each step
  SVC->>DB: save resources (optimistic lock on state_version)
  SVC->>DB: remediation record EXECUTED + audit REMEDIATION_APPLIED
  SVC->>ENG: run_scan() verification re-analysis
  ENG-->>SVC: findings no longer detected?
  SVC->>DB: finding RESOLVED / remediation VERIFIED + audit REMEDIATION_VERIFIED
  SVC-->>UI: EXECUTED + VERIFIED (or NOT_RESOLVED)
  UI-->>U: before/after, score and run-rate
